[agent] **Approach:**
[agent] - Uploaded the two CSVs to HopsFS, then ran one platform job (`ccpipe6c34e0`) that does the full Feature → Training → Inference flow via the `hopsworks` SDK + pandas/sklearn on platform compute.
[agent] - **Feature engineering** (leakage-free): per-card home location, amount z-score / ratio-to-mean, hour & day-of-week, haversine distance from home and from previous txn, time-since-previous, implied travel speed, 1h/24h transaction counts, and category one-hot. Velocity/geo signals are computed over the combined card timeline so each scoring row uses its true prior transaction.
[agent] - Card reference stats derived **only** from labelled history; scoring features computed identically.
[agent] - Trained a class-balanced `HistGradientBoostingClassifier`, evaluated ROC AUC on the held-out split, registered with metrics, refit on all history, scored every row of `score_transactions.csv`, and wrote results to the online+offline predictions table.
[agent] **One environment note:** `hops sql`/Trino failed with a TLS IP-SAN mismatch against a query node (`10.112.103.122`) — a transport issue on that endpoint only. All other read paths (`fg info`, `fg preview` via the Feature Query Service, `model info`) work, and the preview confirms predictions read back through the platform.
